{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1000_p", "source_sha256": "41335e85107d53e3ad4070415a316aa0346cc164a230a0809cc89442f7149150", "ja": "（ふ～……なんだかやたらと忙しいな、最近。\n猫の手も借りたいっていうのは、このことか……）", "zh": "（呼——……最近真是忙得不得了啊。\n所谓忙到连猫爪都想借来用，就是这种情况吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "8f7b14b3380901cce114f600b98424070bf4aaa418ffbfeee0402d2b62520e66", "ja": "お待たせ、{$P$}ちゃん！\n助けを呼ぶ声を聞きつけて、茜ちゃん参上だよ！", "zh": "让你久等啦，{$P$}！听到求助的声音，小茜闪亮登场啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a6b95e0373aae6b5bc6c3b5ba39f6bf7702b98b153be6d39493680fac8b0d55e", "ja": "えっ、茜？　これからリハがあるんじゃ……。", "zh": "咦，茜？你接下来不是要彩排吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "8c8354e22ccf9fb45a219f032d9b9d841b7ed1225f97e52c612f4e5bdccfdbe3", "ja": "人助けのためなら、そんなことはどうでもいいのだー！\nなぜなら、今の茜ちゃんはヒーローだからね！", "zh": "为了帮助别人，那种事怎样都无所谓啦——！\n因为现在的小茜可是英雄嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f6e80b06bb7134e0d921c5a283ba76b032e954a3c05132495a15af54d44b7882", "ja": "こら！　そんなことって……！", "zh": "喂！什么叫“那种事”啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "c780499dbdb4eed5259178feb0c53aaf808be5be959b0626a28dc7b7313f0dcc", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん！　茜ちゃんは\n心配なんだよ、{$P$}ちゃんの事が！", "zh": "{$P$}！小茜很担心你啊，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "49cdc3fea4b2a8cc86cce11e286218bfd67b9c65f2f8601a516670775d7ab83c", "ja": "最近忙しそうだよね？　強がらなくていいんだよ。\nスーパーヒーロー茜ちゃんがお助けするからね！", "zh": "最近看起来很忙吧？不用逞强哦。\n超级英雄小茜来帮你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1007_p", "source_sha256": "51a7f7ea3d4a192f4551263f852b6622b28fa7bc3135a8a484ef4d0873e96f78", "ja": "うーん……まあ、心配かけたのは悪かったな。\n確かに仕事は詰まってるけど。", "zh": "嗯……让你担心了，确实是我不对。\n工作确实堆得满满的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "c4fcc531b4d4560c5f79397d6fd20c05778a04534976c39db25cf8244e90ff75", "ja": "おおっと、それは一大事だね！\nそんな時こそ、茜ちゃんの出番だよ。むむむ……！", "zh": "哎呀，那可不得了！这种时候就该轮到小茜出场了。唔唔唔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "a266399ec1357ebb50f6af226af369666a752bd24467b234d815b571b7e9f7e7", "ja": "ピンときた！　{$P$}ちゃんは\n今、定期公演のマーケティングで悩んでいるね？", "zh": "我灵光一闪！{$P$}现在正为定期公演的营销发愁，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1010_p", "source_sha256": "941bfbe16830ea0cf4960a16457da4c84b302619ef38aa787376b8b7ca40a318", "ja": "えっ、よくわかったな……。\n……あ、さては。資料を覗き見したのか？", "zh": "咦，你居然看出来了……  \n……啊，难道你偷看资料了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "b4f8c090b20a827d6b31fc5d9c6558a70053507c975985634c9a86335734612b", "ja": "ち、違うよ！　サイキックパワーだよ！\n茜ちゃんイヤーは、事件の予兆を聞き取るのだ～！", "zh": "不、不是啦！是超能力哦！\n小茜耳朵能听见案件的预兆哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f24b1d1adcde51675ec20c30653156a001681b75a1217db95676838c2a15e89d", "ja": "（なるほど、盗み聞きか）", "zh": "（原来如此，是偷听啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "9fa7fa60e6233d4e9944f52c6f9eab4d750186e21e1e92eddb8f3afa2efb64a0", "ja": "今の茜ちゃんは、正義の力に満ち溢れている……！\nまさに、マキシマム・パワー！", "zh": "现在的小茜，浑身充满了正义的力量……！\n简直就是，最大力量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "070ad97a13578aa8dc9d002f945978a0e84ad4b410b6ee9527874feb9695c556", "ja": "律子さんの荷物運びを手伝ったり、莉緒やんの相談に\n乗ったり！　桃子ちゃんが忘れた踏み台もすぐに発見！", "zh": "帮律子小姐搬了行李，给莉绪姐\n当了倾听者！还马上就找到了桃子落下的踏台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "31ad7d0568242d05226b9fe555ef0ec51ac80f9fbac58492517436225b34528a", "ja": "おかげで冷蔵庫には、お礼のプリンがたくさん！\n{$P$}ちゃんも頼っていいんだよ？", "zh": "多亏这样，冰箱里有好多作为谢礼的布丁！\n{$P$}也可以来找我帮忙哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a9ca10f148dc763db76f6b8bb36666818e9d4d3e9923fe3379dea9e10b5db28c", "ja": "へえ……人助けはいいことだけど、今はいいよ。\nそれよりリハの準備をしてくれ。", "zh": "哦……帮助别人是好事，不过现在先不用了。比起这个，先准备彩排吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "1b1f9b36273fd30ed3e1ec4ab4f520a2e3e81f2146b8c5627b2c98550c1200fb", "ja": "えっ、ナンデ！？　{$P$}ちゃん！\n茜ちゃんの新鮮なアイディアがいらないの……？", "zh": "诶，为什么！？{$P$}！\n难道不需要小茜的新鲜点子吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "89c72c2ddf69cec7f0ac7fee0e672d39db47dd82f4b3865a8b67621cc1961006", "ja": "茜ちゃん、少しも役に立てないなんて……。\nこれじゃヒーロー失格だよ！", "zh": "小茜，居然一点忙都帮不上……\n这样可就不配当英雄了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2383eaad3f939b6e5f6481c547831a2ee07a4eccd9230f234ba0d78c958988af", "ja": "そうじゃなくて。茜を頼りにしてるからだよ。\n確かに茜は、たまに面白いアイディアをくれるけど。", "zh": "不是那样。正因为我很依赖茜。\n确实，茜偶尔会给出一些有趣的点子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1020_p", "source_sha256": "cfc113e15ee98001aff91d52588257d26b22753f98fa077d53aab739998dff82", "ja": "今はステージを、全力で頑張って欲しいんだ。\nそれは茜にしかできないことだからな。", "zh": "现在，我希望你能全力以赴地站上舞台。\n因为这是只有茜才能做到的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "b4b1d97841f76aa1a2fb356a5d1715e57ab2c1d7d779343c06e610dea1012332", "ja": "はっ！？　それって……。\nここは俺に任せて先に行け、みたいなヤツだね！", "zh": "哈！？那是……  \n“这里交给我，你先走”之类的桥段吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "b4224c9e1af7a6c44ac421cad7c8070982566bffc0272c41c0c12b5dc4174a3c", "ja": "わかったよ{$P$}ちゃん！\nそのお願い、ヒーロー茜ちゃんが確かに聞き届けた！", "zh": "明白啦，{$P$}！\n这个请求，英雄小茜确实听到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0214_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "89df97af5f6109fe98603c4c7e7bf5e6e6ea5f36e986747c74457236bfb27acb", "ja": "あ、お代のプリンはツケておくから、冷蔵庫に\n入れておいてね！　それじゃ……シュバッ！", "zh": "啊，布丁的账先记着，帮我放进冰箱里哦！那就……咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
